  "description": "In the early winter, my first love returned without warning.\n\nNeoul, who was the warm sanctuary that pulled Dodam, a timid country girl, out into the world.\n\nHowever, the Neoul we met again has lost his warmth and pushes Dodam away like a stranger.\n\nThat winter, when time, which seemed to have stopped, began to flow again.\n\nCan we melt Neoul's freezing season?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=854615), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14685983)",
